### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 10 - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen clicking a OptionButtonin on a second native window the popup is displayed in the main window.\n\nIt is also possible to open multiple option buttons by clicking them oneafter another and their popups are all displayed in the other window (see video). The not closing of other popups could be related to #99438\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. add a window with an OptionButton and items\n2. make the window native and invisible\n3. add a script to popup the second window on ready:\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n\n@onready var window: Window = $Window\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\twindow.popup_centered()\n\n```\n4. click on the OptionButton and realize the popup does not appear\n5. realise the popup did appear, but in the main window\n\ndemonstration video of MRP:\n\n[demo](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/69a0828d-4f42-43cb-8002-a040793f84df)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[OptionButton_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20357567/OptionButton_bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user